WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Mine shows the illustrative draft.
Its claim needs the area-pricing condition.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.200
Changes shows the staged suggestion in the manuscript.
The added wording names the condition.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Edit lets the author put the condition in their own words
before saving anything to the manuscript.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.300
Accept saves the author's version to the excerpt.
The app offers Undo.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.300
Undo restores the original wording
and reopens the suggestion.
